<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ANZ to cut some fixed home loans.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ANZ to cut some fixed home loans.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australia and New Zealand Banking Group Ltd (ANZ) said on Friday it would cut interest rates on two-year to five-year fixed home loans and on two to five-year fixed residential investment property loans, effective on Monday.</p>
</text>
